{
  "_comment": "将此文件重命名为 .i18n-viewer.json 放在项目根目录来配置 i18n Key Translator。",

  "defaultLang": "zh",

  "languages": ["en", "zh", "ja"],

  "remoteSources": {
    "en": "https://example.com/locales/en.json",
    "zh": "https://example.com/locales/zh.json",
    "ja": "https://example.com/locales/ja.json"
  },

  "localPaths": [
    "locales/{lang}.json",
    "public/locales/{lang}/translation.json",
    "src/i18n/{lang}.json"
  ],

  "_comment_keyPrefix": [
    "keyPrefix 是在执行翻译查找之前预先添加到每个提取的键前缀。",
    "当你的翻译文件使用带公共命名空间前缀的扁平键/值结构，",
    "而你的源代码只引用短键时，这非常有用。",
    "",
    "扁平翻译文件示例 (zh.json):",
    "  {",
    "    \"isv-common.language.ar\": \"阿拉伯语\",",
    "    \"isv-common.language.bg\": \"保加利亚语\"",
    "  }",
    "",
    "设置 keyPrefix 为 \"isv-common.language.\" 后，调用:",
    "  formatMessage('ar')",
    "将在翻译文件中查找完整键 \"isv-common.language.ar\"。",
    "",
    "查找顺序（首次命中即停止）:",
    "  1. data[prefix + key]       — 带前缀的扁平格式（推荐）",
    "  2. data.prefix.key          — 带前缀的嵌套点表示法（回退）",
    "  3. data[key]                — 无前缀的扁平格式（回退）",
    "  4. data.key                 — 无前缀的嵌套点表示法（回退）",
    "",
    "设为 \"\" 或省略以禁用前缀行为。"
  ],
  "keyPrefix": "isv-common.language.",

  "patterns": [
    "formatMessage\\([\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
    "\\$t\\([\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
    "\\bt\\([\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
    "i18n\\.t\\([\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
    "i18n\\([\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
    "gettext\\([\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
    "translate\\([\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
    "intl\\.formatMessage\\(\\{[^}]*id:\\s*[\"']([^\\'\"]+)[\"']",
    "<Trans[^>]+i18nKey=[\"']([^\\'\"]+)[\"']"
  ],

  "cacheDir": ".i18n-cache",

  "ttl": 3600,

  "_comment_cacheFormat": [
    "cacheFormat 控制写入磁盘缓存时如何转换键。",
    "当远程翻译文件的键名很长你想要简化时，这非常有用。",
    "",
    "配置选项:",
    "  enabled:    启用键转换（默认: false）",
    "  strategy:   转换策略: none | extract | removePrefix | replace | custom",
    "  indent:     缓存文件的 JSON 缩进（默认: 2）",
    "",
    "策略: extract - 提取键段（例如，'a.b.c.d' -> 'c.d'）",
    "  extract.skip:      跳过的段数（默认: 0，例如 skip:2,segments:3,from:'start' 表示跳过前2段取3段）",
    "  extract.segments:  保留的段数（默认: 2）",
    "  extract.from:      'end' 或 'start'（默认: 'end'，在跳过后的剩余部分中提取）",
    "",
    "策略: removePrefix - 移除常见前缀",
    "  removePrefix.prefixes: 要移除的前缀字符串数组",
    "",
    "策略: replace - 正则表达式模式替换",
    "  replace.pattern:      正则表达式模式字符串",
    "  replace.replacement: 替换字符串",
    "  replace.flags:        正则表达式标志（默认: 'g'）",
    "",
    "策略: custom - 显式键映射",
    "  custom.mappings: { '旧键': '新键', ... }",
    "",
    "示例 - 跳过前2段，保留后面的3段 ('a.b.c.d.e' -> 'c.d.e'):",
    "  { \"enabled\": true, \"strategy\": \"extract\", \"extract\": { \"skip\": 2, \"segments\": 3, \"from\": \"start\" } }",
    "",
    "示例 - 提取最后 2 段:",
    "  { \"enabled\": true, \"strategy\": \"extract\", \"extract\": { \"segments\": 2, \"from\": \"end\" } }",
    "",
    "示例 - 移除前缀:",
    "  { \"enabled\": true, \"strategy\": \"removePrefix\", \"removePrefix\": { \"prefixes\": [\"isv-common.\"] } }"
  ],
  "cacheFormat": {
    "enabled": false,
    "strategy": "none",
    "indent": 2,
    "extract": {
      "skip": 0,
      "segments": 2,
      "from": "end"
    },
    "removePrefix": {
      "prefixes": []
    }
  }
}